    "title": "Theme tokens for Ant / MUI / Fluent / shadcn",
    "markdown": "# Theme tokens for Ant / MUI / Fluent / shadcn\n\n> Live in [demo 74-theme-integrations](https://svgrid.com/#/demos/74-theme-integrations).\n\n## When\n\nMap your design system's tokens to --sg-* and the grid re-skins.\n\n## How\n\nKey API surface:\n\n- `CSS custom properties only - no JS API`\n\nSee the demo source for the full implementation; this recipe pins the\npattern + the surface so you can copy-paste it confidently. The doc\npage that explains the underlying feature in depth is linked from the\n[recipes index](./index.md).\n\n## See also\n\n- [Demo 74-theme-integrations source](https://github.com/sv-grid/sv-grid/blob/main/examples/src/demos/74-theme-integrations.svelte)\n- [Demo 74-theme-integrations prompt sidecar](https://github.com/sv-grid/sv-grid/blob/main/examples/src/demos/prompts/74-theme-integrations.md) - drop into an LLM context window\n- [Recipes index](./index.md)\n"
